# Files uploaded to Vercel are served publicly. Everything a browser does not
# need to render the site, and everything the API functions do not read at
# runtime, is excluded here.
#
# This is not hypothetical tidiness. Before this file existed,
# https://www.familyfindersbook.com/ served /tests/test-webhook.mjs (the webhook
# signature scheme, the token parameter name, and every MailerLite group id),
# /scripts/check-secrets.mjs (exactly which credential patterns are scanned
# for), /docs/PRIVATE-PAYHIP-FILES.md, /areas/finders-book.md (the internal
# operational runbook), and the CI workflow — all 200 OK on the commercial
# domain. No secret values leaked, but the design of every protected path did.
#
# scripts/check-deploy-surface.mjs fails the build if a new development-only
# path appears without being listed here.

# Documentation and internal notes
docs/
areas/
README.md
SECURITY.md

# Development tooling — never part of the served site
scripts/
tests/
apply-chrome.py
.github/

# Local config references (dotfiles are not served, listed for intent)
.env.example
.gitattributes
